‎
‎## 7. Connection to Current — AI Coding / LLM / Agents
‎
‎Not because ChatGPT is Yahoo. Because recurring mechanics.
‎
‎**Present crossroads (example: coding):**
‎
‎> What business are we in?
‎> Are we:
‎> the destination that writes code?
‎> or
‎> the mechanism through which intent becomes system?
‎
‎If you think you are destination (code producer), you optimize for producing more code.
‎
‎If you think you are mechanism (judgment, architecture, verification — Rule #14 + #13), you optimize for:
‎
‎- Problem definition
‎- Verification
‎- Taste
‎- Accountability
‎
‎That is Dispatch 013 relocation: scarce skill moves.
‎
‎**Yahoo lesson for today:**
‎
‎Correctly understanding present (AI writes code now) is not enough.
‎Must ask: Where is road going? (Judgment becomes scarce)
‎
‎If you build for present, you become Yahoo portal — valuable now, infrastructure underneath you becomes more valuable later.
‎
‎**This is why Inventory First [[KQ_LOG_2026-08-25]] matters:**
‎
‎> Prove flywheel moves reliably before adding resources — because where road is going determines what flywheel should be.
‎
